<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Primac year net profit up 41 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Primac year net profit up 41 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    3.09  vs   5.50</p>
<p>    Net				     4.31  vs   3.04</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	   15.0   vs  22.0</p>
<p>Note: Primac Holdings Ltd is a stock and station agent.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	   25.0   vs  25.0</p>
<p>    Sales				 200.61  vs 180.68</p>
<p>    Other income			  4.20  vs   4.12</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  25.4   vs  17.9</p>
<p>    Abnormal items	     gain   2.37  vs   0.44 loss</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>Pay date November 7</p>
<p>Reg date October 25</p>
<p>    Tax				     1.82  vs   1.75</p>
<p>    Interest				2.59  vs   1.97</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  2.89  vs   2.84</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
